# Last matching pattern wins.
#
# The file decides WHO reviews; the repository ruleset makes that review
# blocking. /.github/workflows/ must be security-owned, or anyone who can
# open a PR can edit the workflow that gates their own PR — the gates
# become self-modifying.

*                       @kestrel/platform-team
/policy/                @kestrel/platform-team @kestrel/security-team
/live/management/       @kestrel/platform-team @kestrel/security-team
/.github/workflows/     @kestrel/platform-team @kestrel/security-team  # or CI becomes the bypass
